{
 "feature": "Item Dropper (on-demand spawner, any time, even idle)",
 "notes": "Primary hook: ItemDropManager.SpawnItem(Vector3 pos, Item item, ItemInstance attribute, ...) — call it directly with the player position and an Item resolved from the runtime database (ItemInRMDatabase.itemCanBeMade / itemInRMs, or InvDatabase.FindByID). LootType enum: Item=0, Gold=1, Ruby=2. DropItem prefabs: DropItem (Gold/Ruby/Abyssal/Gale/Glacial/Inferno/Void Soul). LootMagnet handles auto-pickup. Per-item stats (rarity/baseStats/sellPrice) are NOT in the shipped APK — the item must be resolved at runtime, and rarity/ enhancement are set on the ItemInstance passed to SpawnItem. See items.json.",
